menu "runIT"

    config RUNIT_BLE_START
        bool "Start BLE at boot"
        default y
        help
          Off for QEMU: it emulates no Bluetooth controller (the controller
          init asserts). The runIT GATT table, the BLE router link and the BLE
          stream bindings are still set up; only NimBLE is not started.
          sdkconfig.qemu.defaults turns it off for the QEMU build.

endmenu
